     2	
     3	- **(a), folder level.** Within the scored span, exclude articles v29 read from 07-20 through 08-24 and articles v34 read from 07-20 through 08-28. Earlier-corpus runs can add exclusions through 08-15. The split tests and smoke test can add exclusions on 08-29 and 08-30.
     4	- **(b), article level.** Exempting the two production replays themselves would keep 07-20 through 08-28 eligible, less articles used in decisions, derived research, or other reads. The 08-29 and 08-30 tests still count. Under either reading, 08-31 through 09-20 is beyond these folders’ reach, and the full census determines eligibility.
